# generated from system: edit there
# Keep LF line endings in every clone, on every system. Reason: the checks read LF only, and on Windows
# core.autocrlf=true would otherwise turn every text file into CRLF at checkout (rules: a tool's standard
# configuration file, no page header).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.bundle binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
